G5 is complete and the game is running. Summary of this step:

**G5: DialogueBox mock-up** (committed as `02d8357` + `38524d9` on `feat/week6-dev-b-story-town-art`, pushed)

- **Scene/script:** `scenes/dialogue/dialogue_box.tscn` + `scripts/dialogue/dialogue_box.gd` — CanvasLayer (layer 20) with portrait `TextureRect` (96×96, hidden when a dialogue has no portrait), name plate, typewriter `RichTextLabel` (0.05 s/char, advance/skip, Dim click-to-skip that also consumes the world click), choice buttons emitting `choice_selected(choice_index, choice)`, placeholder visuals from `UiPalette` (parchment/bronze/ink). Gameplay-safe per co-op spec: pauses local input via input swallow rather than `get_tree().paused`. Docstring carries `local_peer` ownership and "MOCK-UP — awaiting design review".
- **Wiring:** `StoryManager.start_dialogue(dialogue_id, npc)` → load JSON → `EvalContext.from_profile(local_peer)` entry selection → show → choice resolution → `on_end.set_flags`. Per-player in town.
